%% PakVoice AI — Activity: Content Generation
flowchart TD
  Start([Start]) --> Auth{JWT valid?}
  Auth -->|No| Reject([401 Reject])
  Auth -->|Yes| Form[Receive GenerateRequest]
  Form --> Validate[Validate business fields<br/>content type industry city language]
  Validate --> KB{use_knowledge_base?}

  KB -->|No| Prompt
  KB -->|Yes| Count{Chroma has docs?}
  Count -->|No| Prompt
  Count -->|Yes| Embed[Embed search query]
  Embed --> Search[Retrieve top-k chunks<br/>optional selected_doc_ids]
  Search --> Prompt[Build Pakistani prompt<br/>+ optional RAG context]

  Prompt --> CallLLM[Call OpenAI LLM<br/>stream or sync]
  CallLLM --> Ok{Success?}
  Ok -->|No| Err([Return error])
  Ok -->|Yes| Save[Save GenerationHistoryItem<br/>to history.json]
  Save --> Resp[Return content + sources<br/>tokens cost timing]
  Resp --> End([End])
